# LLM Configuration
# Choose your LLM provide: "ollama" (Free), "openai", or "openai_compatible"

# Option 1: Ollama (Free - Recommended for local/free usage)
# Install: https://ollama.ai
# Run: ollama pull llama3.2
# No API keys needed!

# Option 2: OpenAI (Requires API key and costs money)
# OPEN_API_KEY = sk-your-openai-api-key-here

# Options3: OpenAI-compatible endpoints (e.g., LM studio, vLLLM, Openrouter, etc.)
# Configure your model settings in config/settings.yaml